---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Affordable Childcare Options | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's affordable childcare options with flexible payments and financial assistance programs.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/group_snack_time_healthy_eating_background.jpg" 
        alt="Affordable childcare" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Affordable Childcare Options</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Affordable childcare with flexible payments and financial assistance programs for families.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Affordable Childcare Options at Marietta Childcare</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides affordable childcare options for budget-conscious families. Marietta Childcare believes quality childcare should be accessible to all families.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Payment Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers flexible payment options to accommodate family budgets. Payment options at Marietta Childcare include weekly and monthly billing. Marietta Childcare's flexible payment approach makes childcare more affordable.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's payment flexibility reduces financial burden on families. Payment plans at Marietta Childcare can be customized to family circumstances. Marietta Childcare's commitment to affordability supports family financial planning.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Financial Assistance Programs</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare accepts childcare subsidy vouchers and tuition assistance. Financial assistance at Marietta Childcare helps eligible families access quality care. Marietta Childcare participates in Georgia's childcare subsidy program.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrollment team helps families navigate financial assistance programs. Assistance information at Marietta Childcare includes eligibility requirements and application processes. Marietta Childcare's support helps families access available resources.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Part-Time and Flexible Enrollment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers part-time and flexible enrollment options. Part-time care at Marietta Childcare reduces costs for families with flexible needs. Marietta Childcare's flexible enrollment accommodates various family situations.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's part-time options provide affordable alternatives to full-time care. Flexible enrollment at Marietta Childcare allows families to customize their childcare. Marietta Childcare's affordability options serve diverse family needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Included Services and Value</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's tuition includes comprehensive services and materials. Included services at Marietta Childcare provide excellent value for families. Marietta Childcare's tuition covers meals, snacks, and educational materials.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's curriculum and programming are included in tuition. Value at Marietta Childcare includes quality education and care. Marietta Childcare's comprehensive services maximize family investment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Transparent Pricing</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains transparent pricing with no hidden fees. Pricing at Marietta Childcare is clearly communicated to families. Marietta Childcare's transparency helps families budget for childcare.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrollment team explains all costs and fees. Pricing information at Marietta Childcare is provided before enrollment. Marietta Childcare's transparent approach builds family trust.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Sibling Discounts and Promotions</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare may offer sibling discounts for families with multiple children. Discounts at Marietta Childcare help reduce costs for larger families. Marietta Childcare's promotions support family affordability.</p>
          <p>Families should ask about available discounts and promotions at Marietta Childcare. Special offers at Marietta Childcare may include enrollment incentives. Marietta Childcare's discounts make quality care more accessible.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Quality Education at Affordable Prices</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides quality education at affordable prices. Quality programming at Marietta Childcare includes research-based curriculum and trained educators. Marietta Childcare's commitment to quality does not compromise affordability.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's affordable approach ensures all children access quality care. Education at Marietta Childcare prepares children for kindergarten success. Marietta Childcare's value proposition supports family investment in early education.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Budget Planning and Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's enrollment team helps families plan budgets for childcare. Budget support at Marietta Childcare includes discussing payment options and assistance programs. Marietta Childcare's team works with families to find affordable solutions.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's financial counseling helps families understand costs. Support at Marietta Childcare includes information about financial assistance. Marietta Childcare's commitment to affordability includes budget planning assistance.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Affordable Quality Childcare</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare is committed to providing affordable, quality childcare. Contact Marietta Childcare to discuss pricing, payment options, and financial assistance.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Contact Us</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Much Does Childcare Cost?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Solutions for Working Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/single-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Support for Single Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
